Root cause:
The bug arises from the reliance on semaphore inter-engine synchronization without the support of timeslicing and preemption on certain architectures (Broadwell/Braswell). Since the no-semaphore boosting has been removed, the absence of timeslicing leads to potential deadlocks or improper handling of inter-engine dependencies, as semaphores cannot be used effectively without preemption.

Code statements information:
The code statements that lead to the bug are:
